    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "The Lord Is on Our Side"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A song of ascents. Of David."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "If the Lord had not been on our side —",
          "let Israel say —"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "if the Lord had not been on our side",
          "when people attacked us,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "then they would have swallowed us alive",
          "in their burning anger against us."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then the water would have engulfed us;",
          "the torrent would have swept over us;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "the raging water would have swept over us."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Blessed be the Lord,",
          "who has not let us be ripped apart by their teeth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "We have escaped like a bird from the hunter’s net;",
          "the net is torn, and we have escaped."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Our help is in the name of the Lord,",
          "the Maker of heaven and earth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
